 Lead actuarial transformation projects aimed at modernizing experience studies, data, tools, and analytical capabilities, from identifying business needs through to solution implementation;
 Enhance processes related to financial results to improve reliability and efficiency, strengthen controls, and foster greater team autonomy;
 Translate complex actuarial and operational issues into structured, sustainable solutions aligned with business needs;
